Font,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">xAI 发布 Voice Agent Builder 测试版，支持两分钟构建生产级语音智能体</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta正式建立云业务并转售闲置AI算力，受此消息影响股价大涨10%</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AI云平台Together AI完成8亿美元C轮融资，估值达83亿美元</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌大幅提升Gemini API免费额度，Gemini 2.5 Flash模型TPM达百万级</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌近日宣布全面扩容Gemini API免费额度，重点针对Gemini 2.5 Flash与Flash-Lite模型，将其单分钟Token处理上限（TPM）提升至100万。此次调整延续了免绑卡、不限总量的低门槛策略，旨在降低个人开发者与初创团队的试错成本。尽管TPM大幅放宽，但各模型的请求频率限制（RPM）仍维持在每分钟15至30次，每日请求总量（RPD）锁定在1500次，且高端Pro版本暂未纳入免费队列。谷歌明确指出，免费层级下的Prompt与反馈内容可能被用于模型训练，开发者需评估数据合规风险。行业分析认为，谷歌此举意在通过极致的性价比吸引开发者迁入其API生态，以应对开源模型在推理服务市场的竞争压力。开发者可通过官方页面查询账户具体额度，并根据业务敏感度决定是否升级至付费版本。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">支付宝AI生活助理“阿宝”正式开启全量公测，上线72项高频办事技能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f8d9d652bef366d08d46ac221e5968c0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月2日，支付宝AI生活助理“阿宝”正式面向全量用户开启公测，iOS与安卓用户无需邀请码，通过应用商店或App内搜索即可直接体验。该产品基于生活服务垂域模型，在经历一个月内测后，重点围绕服务生态与用户陪伴体系升级。目前，“阿宝”已覆盖政务、缴费、文旅等十余类板块，并精选出72项高频刚需技能，支持用户通过自然对话跨页面、跨应用完成复杂任务，如多条件旅游规划及对话式电商购物。此外，新版本引入“亲密度”陪伴体系，支持闲聊、解压建议及表情包互动，强化人格化体验。支付宝表示，用户可在原版本与全新AI版之间自由切换。此次公测标志着支付宝AI应用正式进入大规模场景实践阶段，旨在通过垂域模型能力提升生活服务的智能化办理效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">xAI 发布 Voice Agent Builder 测试版，支持两分钟构建生产级语音智能体</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2772f6c808deb0ee7e56fb6db3c0cb82.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">xAI 正式发布 Voice Agent Builder 测试版，该零代码平台基于自研 Grok Voice 模型，旨在降低企业级语音智能体开发门槛。在 τ-voice Bench 评测中，核心模型 Grok Voice Think Fast 1.0 得分 67.3%，优于 Gemini 3.1 Flash Live 与 GPT Realtime 1.5。该平台采用端到端架构，集成电话通信、知识库检索、MCP 服务器连接及 Guardrails 合规防护，支持用户通过自然语言描述目标并上传文档快速配置。开发者可调用 API 连接器实现预约、订单查询等闭环业务，并支持 80 多种内置音色及两分钟音频样本克隆。商业化方面，平台不收额外使用费，仅按 API 计费 0.05 美元/分钟，电话服务加收 0.01 美元/分</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta正式建立云业务并转售闲置AI算力，受此消息影响股价大涨10%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0dd2f9343c818630e26c716e892d3116.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta正式宣布建立云业务，通过转售其闲置的AI计算资源及开放AI模型访问权限，开辟全新的B端变现路径。作为NVIDIA GPU的全球最大买家之一，Meta今年在AI基础设施上的投入高达1450亿美元，尽管已推出由Alexandr Wang领导研发的大模型Muse Spark，但庞大的硬件投资仍存在算力冗余。该策略效仿SpaceX租售算力的商业模式，旨在优化资产利用率并缓解高额资本开支压力。受此战略转型消息提振，Meta股价盘中上涨约10%。随着科技巨头在AI军备竞赛中硬件投入走向阶段性过剩，算力转售正成为头部企业优化资源配置的关键手段，这也标志着传统云计算市场格局将迎来由超级科技巨头引发的新一轮重塑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI云平台Together AI完成8亿美元C轮融资，估值达83亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/167727c29f8a8a9156fba8a89a64dcfd.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI基础设施及云服务平台Together AI今日宣布完成8亿美元C轮融资，公司估值达到83亿美元。本轮融资由沙特阿美创投领投，英伟达、Vista Equity Partners等机构参投。Together AI成立于2022年，定位为“Neocloud”技术服务商，核心业务是提供英伟达GPU集群等AI专用基础设施租赁。得益于企业对高性能、低成本开源模型需求的激增，该公司上一季度年度预订额已突破11.5亿美元，拥有包括Cursor、Cognition、Decagon在内的数千家付费客户。此次融资距离其B轮仅过去16个月，资金将用于进一步扩大算力基础设施规模。随着全球开源模型使用量在一年内增长两倍，Together AI的快速扩张反映了算力主导权正加速向具备成本优势的开源生态及新型云服务商倾斜，为企业提供替代封闭</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
